<h1>Title with <code>code</code> and <strong>bold</strong></h1>
<p>Intro paragraph spans two source lines and has <em>emphasis</em>, <em>under</em>, a <a href="https://example.com/a?b=1">link</a>, a doc, a bad) and <img src="img.png" alt="alt">.</p>
<h2>Escapes &amp; entities</h2>
<p>Raw &lt;b&gt;bold&lt;/b&gt; &amp; &quot;quotes&quot; and 'apostrophes' must be escaped.</p>
<p>Inline <code>a &lt; b &amp; c &gt; d</code> stays literal; `<code> </code> `<code> edge; unterminated </code> tick.</p>
<h3>Links and images</h3>
